            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Controller 1.0.26 improves browser tools and agent reliability.

- Browser actions can return a snapshot in the same call, with clearer controls and smaller responses.
- Agents can use the browser console and upload files without opening a file dialog.
- Shared native tool connections reduce per-thread overhead and improve retry guidance.
- Pi records accepted prompts in the durable transcript, and stopped Antigravity turns settle more reliably.
]]></description>
