        <item>
            <title>1.0.25</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 22:07:59 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/mweinbach/Controller</link>
            <sparkle:version>27</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.25</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Controller 1.0.25 improves thread handling, model controls, and file previews.

- Settled threads return to the inbox when you send a message or new work starts.
- Cursor plan approval can continue implementation with your chosen model.
- Thread titles can use attached images.
- Pi work stays in feed order, with improved shell activity classification.
- Refined context and model controls, transcript loading, and Quick Look previews.

ControllerMobile 1.0.14 also adds a preference for dismissing the composer keyboard.
]]></description>
